ete with others and test your pancake-making skills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300aRules\u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make pancakes to order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack them up high, then add scrumptious toppings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep cooking until time runs out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300aHow to Play\u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Spread the batter on the pan and start cooking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Once one side is cooked, flip it over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Flip fully cooked pancakes onto a plate and start adding toppings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Add fruit on top! Choose from strawberries, nuts, bananas, blueberries, kiwi, and mango!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Drizzle on a sauce! Choose from chocolate sauce, cream, and honey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Once the pancakes are done, it's time to serve! The closer they match the order, the more points you get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To receive news and update notifications</strong><br>Please click on <strong>Developer: SAT-BOX</strong> at the top of the store page and <strong>Follow</strong> us!</p>","developers":["SAT-BOX"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928650/c9b977cb7fcbc0106919d7507ec428599e1a8aec/header.jpg?t=1773042162","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 SAT-BOX. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3928650/609897996/a57eff9eb8b3c7757cd9f6ecd987ab70673789c1